LWA    SYN FWA-1        LAST WORD ADDRESS IN ADDRESS.                   ODD 0868
T      SYN LWA-3        SUB-PROGRAM TEMP. STORAGE.                      ODD 0869
DLESS8 SYN T-1          EFFECTIVE ADDRESS, + 8, + DLESS8 IS TRUE ADDRESSODD 0870
LAST   SYN DLESS8-1     COMPLEMENT OF EFFECTIVE LWA+9 IN DECREMENT.     ODD 0871
BS     SYN LAST-8       BLANKS AND SIGNS OF WORDS.                      ODD 0872
EX     SYN BS-8         BCDDECIMAL EXPONENTS OF DECIMAL WORDS.          ODD 0873
F      SYN EX-8         FIRST TWO DIGITS OF DECIMAL WORDS IN OCTAL INDECODD 0874
H      SYN F-8          REMAINDER OF DECIMAL WORDS, TIMES 100, IN OCTAL.ODD 0875
DX     SYN H-79         TABLE OF SIGNED BCD DECIMAL EXPONENTS.          ODD 0876
FX     SYN DX-256       TABLE RELATING BINARY EXPONENT TO DECIMAL EXP.  ODD 0877
CV     SYN FX-256       CONVERSION FACTORS, TIMES 100.                  ODD 0878
3DD    SYN CV-100       TWO DECIMAL DIGITS, BCD, AT 36.                 ODD 0879
2DD    SYN 3DD-100      TWO DECIMAL DIGITS, BCD, AT 24.                 ODD 0880
1DD    SYN 2DD-100      TWO DECIMAL DIGITS, BCD, AT 12.                 ODD 0881
SWTN   SYN FOUR                                                         ODD 0882
N      SYN 65544-2*1DD  TOTATAL NUMBER OF WORDS ONBINARY TAPE.          ODD 0883
PRA    SYN 1DD          ADDRESS OF FIRST WORD IN PROGRAM REGION.        ODD 0884
TSRA   SYN 2*1DD-32776  ADDRESS OF FIRST WORD IN TEMP-STORAGE REGION.   ODD 0885
J      SYN 36           TWO LESS THAN THE NUMBER OF BINARY CARDS.       ODD 0886
       END RDSAVE REMOVE TRANSFER AND ANY OTHER CARD FROM BACK OF B-DECKODD 0887
